{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_ray_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_ray_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"月下舞者","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_ray_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"32aca173b7520fe405723a0479f2d1fdc714cf7705bbd0c6ab4319ce544ce3bc","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"莱伊在罗德岛获得了安稳的生活，心中却仍执着追寻光与驮兽。在向朋友表达心中所想后，她将带上自己的沙地兽再次启程。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_i03"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巨兽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"算了，小家伙，俺虽然不能挪动身体，但也不是完全动弹不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巨兽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然你难得跑到这里来，俺还有一个小问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巨兽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就当俺是那个“巨兽”，就是你要找的那束光吧——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巨兽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你跑了这么远，是希望俺帮你做什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，请问......你们有看到莱伊吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱伊小姐？我刚才看见她了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚给她打好饭菜，她就一边端着饭盒吃饭一边走了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时她好像在追着一个毛茸茸的影子，应该是她的沙地兽吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢！麻烦你了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesupperdeck"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问......呼......呼......请问你见过莱伊吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的人事干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我今天倒是见到了她好几次......我正奇怪呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的人事干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我上午坐班的时候，看见她出现在那个拐角好多次，而且走路的速度越来越快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的人事干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说来，阿兰娜你好像也出现了很多次......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因......因为我在找她！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的医疗干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"阿、阿兰娜小姐......请问你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没、没事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇——？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？我刚才听整条船的人说你在找我，所以我过来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......我找你找了一整个上午，几乎都要把这艘船翻过来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，我一直在遛沙地兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地兽","speakerId":"AVG_NPC_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（虚弱地瘫倒）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是我的错觉......这只沙地兽是不是大了一圈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大沙地兽？","speakerId":"AVG_NPC_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前段时间活有点多，拜托后勤部的同事帮忙喂了几天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果回来的时候，沙地兽就变成球了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我现在一有空就带它出来散步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莱伊突然像是想起了什么，在自己的上衣口袋里翻找起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个月的分期......不够。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我的饭卡，你先拿去，就当......利息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么还在惦记这事，我不是为了讨债来的......我就是好久没在内部论坛看到你的“轶事”了，想亲自过来看看你的近况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，最近没有安全违规，也不需要签保证书。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（长舒一口气）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早知道不是讨债，就不躲着你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱伊，你不是一直在遛沙地兽吗——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我一直想不出借口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——这——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宿舍——一点——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地方——都没有啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大沙地兽","speakerId":"AVG_NPC_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"两人一兽从沙箱和门之间仅有的缝隙穿过，终于在床边有了一丝落脚的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个沙箱什么时候又变大了一号......也是难为你每天这样进进出出了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷嗷需要更大的空间，我只需要睡觉的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"两人并排坐在床边，一起看着沙地兽在沙箱里大口喝水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得它之前一直都躲在那个石头的角落里......没想到它现在已经不怕我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的人，不凶。上次嗷嗷撞坏靶子，杜宾教官没骂，最后是我们一起修好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好，看见你的生活一点点步入正轨，我就放心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道吗，我现在每天在工程部帮忙调试新设备。虽然忙，但比在矿井里的时候好上千倍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用再担心塌方，不用再喝带着泥沙的水，每天都能吃到热乎的饭菜，晚上还能躺在干净的床上睡觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种安稳的日子，以前在矿井里的时候，我连做梦都不敢想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，罗德岛安稳，安全，什么都有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讲真，我一开始挺担心你会不会不适应这里的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但刚才找你的时候，我看着大家现在都认识你，甚至你们相处还挺融洽，我就彻底不担心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以啊，你也别总想着还钱了。现在生活稳定下来了，你可以好好筹划一下以后的日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给沙地兽弄好窝以后，也给自己添点东西，不要像现在这样节俭......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"就在阿兰娜环视莱伊的宿舍时，她注意到天花板上有一幅海报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......“拓荒”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥伦比亚的旧海报。上次出任务，我从街边小贩那收来的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"海报上印着一片荒芜的大地，而在夜空中，闪烁着无数的星星。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还借了哥伦比亚的纪录片，里面说哥伦比亚的荒原和雷姆必拓的很不一样，地面上有奇怪的图案，天上还飞着各种不同形状的铁块。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是那样的话，有会跳舞的驮兽也很合理。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莱伊伸出了一根手指，指向那海报上的月光，顺着月光的方向，一直到更高处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我准备先把欠你的钱还完，然后就开始攒钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等攒够钱，就租一辆载具，去哥伦比亚的荒原里找那些驮兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......莱伊，你还在想着那群会跳舞的驮兽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，还有那束光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，到底为什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去找那些不一定存在的驮兽，就会失去现在安稳的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可那束光，见过一次后，就再也忘不掉了。就像沙地兽在沙漠里永远都要找水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这里不是沙漠了，沙地兽随时随地都能喝到水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里已经没有深不见底的矿井，罗德岛的任何一个地方都要比矿井亮堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱伊，难道你不喜欢这里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我很喜欢这里，这里比我之前待过的任何一个地方都要好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，你的沙地兽也很喜欢这里吧——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你的沙地兽呢？刚才还在那的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它喝完水，应该是出去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚刚把门关上了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沙箱的开口正对着窗户，而此刻窗户正半敞开着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesupperdeck"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"着急的干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们有看见莱伊小姐的沙地兽吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没有啊，它平时不都是跟着莱伊小姐......怎、怎么了，走丢了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"赶紧帮忙找找吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"监控有死角，没法知道它还在不在船上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去借一辆载具，回头去追！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行！从它跑丢到现在的时间里，罗德岛已经开出去很远了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我必须要找到它......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯器里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿兰娜小姐，阿兰娜小姐！有干员反映甲板吊桥上好像吊着什么东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯器里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看你离那边很近，可以拜托你去检修一下吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甲板吊桥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g14_rhodesdeck_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你......你，你过来点！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，呼......累死我了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的天，它居然能跑到这么高的地方来，胖成这样居然还这么能爬......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大沙地兽","speakerId":"AVG_NPC_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（害怕的叫声）嗷......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沙地兽扑到了莱伊的怀里，用自己的绒毛在莱伊手上蹭来蹭去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是服了它了，罗德岛这么大，它怎么偏偏喜欢往这种高地方跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且明明是我把它救下来的啊，怎么光顾着黏你了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我先去报告情况了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不准蹭我，嗷嗷。做错事了就要受罚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莱伊抓住了沙地兽的两只爪子，将它们高举过沙地兽的头顶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大沙地兽","speakerId":"AVG_NPC_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（抗议的叫声）嗷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快说，你为什么要跑到那么危险的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大沙地兽","speakerId":"AVG_NPC_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（激动的叫声）嗷——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，怎么突然就开始打雷了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，莱伊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗷嗷突然跑到高处，是有原因的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙地兽在荒漠里爬沙丘，有时会站在高处，查看天敌，感知风向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有坏天气的时候，沙地兽也是最先感知到的，所以嗷嗷才会跑出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使罗德岛有遮雨的屋顶，也没有天敌，它还是会这么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我之前听说，经过精心养护，沙地兽其实可以在室内长期生活，不用再回到荒漠里去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能养，可它总是想要回到那里，吹吹荒野的风。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大沙地兽","speakerId":"AVG_NPC_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（精神的叫声）嗷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了......莱伊，你还想念着荒野的日子，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你懂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然不懂啦！我哪知道那束光对你来说到底意味着什么，还有你一直念叨的那群驮兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但我知道那种心里有个念想的感觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我现在虽然在工程部做得很好，但还是会偶尔想起以前当司机时看到的那些美丽的风景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然想去，那就去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢你，兰娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管是为了嗷嗷，还是为了我，谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大沙地兽","speakerId":"AVG_NPC_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（开心的叫声）嗷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱伊，我还有一个问题——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"豆大的雨点自空中落下，荒漠迎来了今年的第一场太阳雨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"narration","text":"数月后"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严谨的干员","speakerId":"AVG_NPC_090","isRemote":false,"text":"莱伊干员，哥伦比亚的这个任务区域比较偏僻，补给点很少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严谨的干员","speakerId":"AVG_NPC_090","isRemote":false,"text":"而且据说最近那一带出现了不明原因的源石能量波动，有一定的风险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我对荒漠很熟悉，沙地兽对气流和温度很敏感，也能帮忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严谨的干员","speakerId":"AVG_NPC_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你的能力很出色，之前参与的几次荒漠救援任务表现都很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严谨的干员","speakerId":"AVG_NPC_090","isRemote":false,"text":"但还是要提醒你，这次任务的周期比较长，至少要一个月，而且通讯可能会不太稳定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"了解，按照任务规范来做。通讯断了，按路线走，去补给点等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严谨的干员","speakerId":"AVG_NPC_090","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，莱伊干员，祝你一切顺利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严谨的干员","speakerId":"AVG_NPC_090","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，对了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？还有什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严谨的干员","speakerId":"AVG_NPC_090","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢你主动承接这个任务，说真的，帮了大忙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......小事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，还好赶上了。我打听到你今天要出任务了，就赶紧给你的沙地兽买了一点储备粮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大沙地兽","speakerId":"AVG_NPC_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（开心的叫声）嗷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你不要谁给你吃的就蹭谁啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"莱伊姐——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......小锅盖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她听我说你要出远门了，非要请假过来送送你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说你也不挑个好时间出发，现在食堂里一堆人等着小锅盖做的晚饭呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温米","speakerId":"AVG_4081_WARMY_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱伊姐，这个是我准备的便当。听说你后面的任务很辛苦，所以我给的分量比平时多了点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，谢谢你，我会全部吃掉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我，走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一路顺风，别忘了回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"会回的。欠你的钱，到时候连本带利还。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都说了不用还啦——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g14_rhodesdeck_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"夕阳下，阿兰娜和温米站在甲板的护栏边，看着莱伊的载具渐行渐远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温米","speakerId":"AVG_4081_WARMY_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兰娜姐，莱伊姐是去找那束光和那群会跳舞的驮兽了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温米","speakerId":"AVG_4081_WARMY_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前刚来罗德岛的时候，她总和我讲它们的故事，我当初还以为是她特意用来哄我的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她当然是自己相信啦，毕竟她可不是会哄人的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温米","speakerId":"AVG_4081_WARMY_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真期待莱伊姐回来讲她的新故事呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我们等她回来，听她讲她见到的故事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g14_rhodesdeck_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（大声）不过我还有一个问题——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（大声）有没有一种可能，也许你已经找到了那束光呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（大声）也许在你的生命中，你已经又见过了那束光，只是你记不清了，所以才意识不到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（更大声）光是追寻本身——已经很有趣了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_0_rhodes3"},{"type":"narration","text":"莱伊有点恍惚。\n她回头看向那艘渐行渐远的陆行舰，记忆仿佛回到了多年前的某个时刻。\n那个她被拯救的日子，一个像山一样巨大的影子，在雾中会散发光线。\n而现在，在那巨大的舰艇上，在一层层晚霞之中的，是她的朋友们。\n那是她要离开的地方，是她将回来的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大沙地兽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（自由的叫声）嗷！"},{"type":"narration","text":"沙地兽的叫声将莱伊的思绪拉回现实，她重新将目光聚焦在前行的道路上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不急，嗷嗷。慢慢走，慢慢找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找不到也没关系，只要在追就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莱伊开着载具，越过了沙丘，往荒原深处驶去。\n身后的夕阳渐渐落下，而身前的月亮逐渐升起。看着月光，她想起了许多。\n她想起了那群迎着月光舞蹈的驮兽，她想起了站在高处远眺的嗷嗷。\n她想起了一直在追寻的自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
